{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1263.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"6b5a33c0e0383f15c7f7615b482973433fa542b0098a5399bc5933e3c1781993","ja":"やっぱり正統派！","zh":"还是正统派好！","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1263.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"cce7e08364ba8bcee3a63e41e846e4292ec87ecfca3092464763316941df0adf","ja":"今日のお仕事はトークショーと雑誌の取材。\nまずはトークショーから……","zh":"今天的工作是脱口秀和杂志采访。\n首先从脱口秀开始……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1263.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"adb8b03f4e6e37f809ec412454b768fd7b10eb90b70d32ebc57665d565f45a9c","ja":"わーい！　みんなでいっぱいトークできるの、\n楽しみですね♪　たくさん盛り上げたいな♪","zh":"太好了！能和大家聊很多很多，\n真令人期待呢♪　希望能好好把气氛炒热♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1263.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"a07fc02df3000d9958e9b4e1a55b1f0d24cd068d55da33be088f066c47cf1bdf","ja":"そうだね、麗花ちゃん！\nかわいく元気に頑張りましょう！！","zh":"你说得对，丽花！\n我们要可爱又元气地加油哦！！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1263.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"60a73860a5aa3be506852c7f31bc5a47f025d6b9543f1917791b65b6d28e7b2d","ja":"いつにも増して\n気合いが入っているようですね、風花。","zh":"比平时还要\n干劲十足呢，风花。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1263.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"31f8a13e419a78ccc1d60f950e1ae4df5b0b72e26aa6c6fb83a377abf622b36e","ja":"うん！　だって……今日は私のイメージを回復する\n絶好のチャンスだから！","zh":"嗯！毕竟……今天可是挽回我形象的\n绝佳机会呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1263.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"5dde92ebc3cd4513f0b409d232333dbc1cc2edaa874e28441a2f9914d59e3fc7","ja":"イメージを回復するチャンスって……。\n風花ちゃん、別に悪いイメージはないと思うわよ？","zh":"说是挽回形象的机会……\n风花，我觉得你并没有什么不好的形象哦？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1263.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"7c7db12762015aa19b488e30b9b79335e444a913d1ac53783fd8fe2166e61f49","ja":"そうですわ。この前の、\nナイトプールのお仕事も好評でしたし。","zh":"确实如此。之前的\n夜间泳池工作也很受好评呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1263.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"8e49a1b0bc66b2a5521ca0ce407bd7e79ad72292c7fa11bf55c5543a84185c17","ja":"ありがとう。でも、そのナイトプールパーティーの\n時の反応が、ずっと気になってて……。","zh":"谢谢。不过，当时那个夜间泳池派对上的\n反应，我一直很在意……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1263.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"dcdb10bddb2c8cad1bf0a4238b5e3d293dea6b98ca052a8b1a75faba5314b19b","ja":"その……「セクシーで最高！」みたいな感じで、\nSNSに書かれてたから……。","zh":"那个……网上发了些\n类似“性感极了，棒呆了！”之类的内容……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1263.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"2d7af490be12c11ef01d3ec15da6e1f8467f2fee04ae50550eb545aa2f1ee069","ja":"風花さん、本当にセクシーでしたもんね！\n大人の魅力たっぷりで！","zh":"风花小姐真的很性感呢！\n散发着满满的成熟魅力！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1263.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"41ed11ccb766ae27fa07759391cb4226e8a9fb9a3f5688a85e0b2a31d19fc7ae","ja":"うう……だから私、今日こそ正統派アイドルとして\nイベントに出たいの！","zh":"呜呜……所以我今天一定要作为正统派偶像\n去参加活动！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1263.unity3d","item_key":"commands[32].text","source_sha256":"57d6a9e386b387cbb259092e59cb70a5a771f5330f243794e090e93cb8f20e34","ja":"清純で爽やかなイメージを持ってもらえるように！","zh":"为了给人留下清纯又清爽的印象！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
